{
  "veyvey": [
    {
      "line": 1,
      "text": "I found a candy wrapper! Or maybe I found lunch.",
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 3.67,
      "duration": 3.67,
      "file": "/Users/louisburwell/Documents/Claude read:write/monster-detectives/audio/lines/veyvey/veyvey_line01.mp3"
    },
    {
      "line": 2,
      "text": "Just checking.",
      "start": 3.59,
      "end": 4.88,
      "duration": 1.29,
      "file": "/Users/louisburwell/Documents/Claude read:write/monster-detectives/audio/lines/veyvey/veyvey_line02.mp3"
    },
    {
      "line": 3,
      "text": "Maybe the mummy got really hot and took its own wrap off.",
      "start": 4.8,
      "end": 8.55,
      "duration": 3.75,
      "file": "/Users/louisburwell/Documents/Claude read:write/monster-detectives/audio/lines/veyvey/veyvey_line03.mp3"
    },
    {
      "line": 4,
      "text": "You call yourself a detective? Mummies live in the desert \u2014 of course they get hot!!",
      "start": 8.47,
      "end": 14.68,
      "duration": 6.21,
      "file": "/Users/louisburwell/Documents/Claude read:write/monster-detectives/audio/lines/veyvey/veyvey_line04.mp3"
    },
    {
      "line": 5,
      "text": "Kobe's already on the case while you two are playing Barbies. I think he found something!",
      "start": 14.6,
      "end": 20.27,
      "duration": 5.67,
      "file": "/Users/louisburwell/Documents/Claude read:write/monster-detectives/audio/lines/veyvey/veyvey_line05.mp3"
    },
    {
      "line": 6,
      "text": "He waited two seconds!! That's twice as long as he usually waits!",
      "start": 20.19,
      "end": 24.71,
      "duration": 4.52,
      "file": "/Users/louisburwell/Documents/Claude read:write/monster-detectives/audio/lines/veyvey/veyvey_line06.mp3"
    },
    {
      "line": 7,
      "text": "I knew it. The scarecrow was hungry and attacked the mummy!",
      "start": 24.63,
      "end": 28.63,
      "duration": 4.0,
      "file": "/Users/louisburwell/Documents/Claude read:write/monster-detectives/audio/lines/veyvey/veyvey_line07.mp3"
    },
    {
      "line": 8,
      "text": "What makes you a scarecrow expert? Apparently they can. How else would he attack the mummy? Hmmmmmm...",
      "start": 28.55,
      "end": 36.56,
      "duration": 8.01,
      "file": "/Users/louisburwell/Documents/Claude read:write/monster-detectives/audio/lines/veyvey/veyvey_line08.mp3"
    },
    {
      "line": 9,
      "text": "Wait. Werewolves and vampire bats don't live downtown \u2014 the rent is too high. What other scary animal could have used its razor-sharp teeth to chew through the rope?",
      "start": 36.48,
      "end": 47.27,
      "duration": 10.79,
      "file": "/Users/louisburwell/Documents/Claude read:write/monster-detectives/audio/lines/veyvey/veyvey_line09.mp3"
    },
    {
      "line": 10,
      "text": "These two crime-solving mummies just solved the case. On the next case, we could use a little help?",
      "start": 47.19,
      "end": 52.87,
      "duration": 5.68,
      "file": "/Users/louisburwell/Documents/Claude read:write/monster-detectives/audio/lines/veyvey/veyvey_line10.mp3"
    },
    {
      "line": 11,
      "text": "That's what leaders do!! We solve cases. Hopefully next time you and Maddie will pitch in.",
      "start": 52.79,
      "end": 58.66,
      "duration": 5.87,
      "file": "/Users/louisburwell/Documents/Claude read:write/monster-detectives/audio/lines/veyvey/veyvey_line11.mp3"
    },
    {
      "line": 12,
      "text": "Per usual, I already solved it!",
      "start": 58.58,
      "end": 61.68,
      "duration": 3.1,
      "file": "/Users/louisburwell/Documents/Claude read:write/monster-detectives/audio/lines/veyvey/veyvey_line12.mp3"
    }
  ],
  "maddie": [
    {
      "line": 1,
      "text": "Okay, everyone. I have a feeling we're going to have the biggest mystery yet. We need to stay focused tonight.",
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 6.11,
      "duration": 6.11,
      "file": "/Users/louisburwell/Documents/Claude read:write/monster-detectives/audio/lines/maddie/maddie_line01.mp3"
    },
    {
      "line": 2,
      "text": "Livy, we haven't even gotten a case yet.",
      "start": 6.03,
      "end": 8.64,
      "duration": 2.61,
      "file": "/Users/louisburwell/Documents/Claude read:write/monster-detectives/audio/lines/maddie/maddie_line02.mp3"
    },
    {
      "line": 3,
      "text": "VayVay \u2014",
      "start": 8.56,
      "end": 9.5,
      "duration": 0.94,
      "file": "/Users/louisburwell/Documents/Claude read:write/monster-detectives/audio/lines/maddie/maddie_line03.mp3"
    },
    {
      "line": 4,
      "text": "That's our case. Let's roll, team.",
      "start": 9.42,
      "end": 11.77,
      "duration": 2.35,
      "file": "/Users/louisburwell/Documents/Claude read:write/monster-detectives/audio/lines/maddie/maddie_line04.mp3"
    },
    {
      "line": 5,
      "text": "KOBE?!",
      "start": 11.69,
      "end": 12.46,
      "duration": 0.77,
      "file": "/Users/louisburwell/Documents/Claude read:write/monster-detectives/audio/lines/maddie/maddie_line05.mp3"
    },
    {
      "line": 6,
      "text": "Everyone knows mummies don't get hot, VayVay.",
      "start": 12.38,
      "end": 15.32,
      "duration": 2.94,
      "file": "/Users/louisburwell/Documents/Claude read:write/monster-detectives/audio/lines/maddie/maddie_line06.mp3"
    },
    {
      "line": 7,
      "text": "KOBE, DROP IT!",
      "start": 15.24,
      "end": 16.92,
      "duration": 1.68,
      "file": "/Users/louisburwell/Documents/Claude read:write/monster-detectives/audio/lines/maddie/maddie_line07.mp3"
    },
    {
      "line": 8,
      "text": "After him!",
      "start": 16.84,
      "end": 17.89,
      "duration": 1.05,
      "file": "/Users/louisburwell/Documents/Claude read:write/monster-detectives/audio/lines/maddie/maddie_line08.mp3"
    },
    {
      "line": 9,
      "text": "KOBE! STAY! Don't you dare take another step, or you are in big trouble, mister!",
      "start": 17.81,
      "end": 23.31,
      "duration": 5.5,
      "file": "/Users/louisburwell/Documents/Claude read:write/monster-detectives/audio/lines/maddie/maddie_line09.mp3"
    },
    {
      "line": 10,
      "text": "Kobe. Little buddy. What did you do?!",
      "start": 23.23,
      "end": 25.85,
      "duration": 2.62,
      "file": "/Users/louisburwell/Documents/Claude read:write/monster-detectives/audio/lines/maddie/maddie_line10.mp3"
    },
    {
      "line": 11,
      "text": "Scarecrows can't move, VayVay.",
      "start": 25.77,
      "end": 28.05,
      "duration": 2.28,
      "file": "/Users/louisburwell/Documents/Claude read:write/monster-detectives/audio/lines/maddie/maddie_line11.mp3"
    },
    {
      "line": 12,
      "text": "And it dragged along the ground all the way behind the toolshed...",
      "start": 27.97,
      "end": 31.72,
      "duration": 3.75,
      "file": "/Users/louisburwell/Documents/Claude read:write/monster-detectives/audio/lines/maddie/maddie_line12.mp3"
    },
    {
      "line": 13,
      "text": "Could've been a werewolf, or maybe a vampire bat.",
      "start": 31.64,
      "end": 36.49,
      "duration": 4.85,
      "file": "/Users/louisburwell/Documents/Claude read:write/monster-detectives/audio/lines/maddie/maddie_line13.mp3"
    },
    {
      "line": 14,
      "text": "Mystery solved. Case closed.",
      "start": 36.41,
      "end": 39.34,
      "duration": 2.93,
      "file": "/Users/louisburwell/Documents/Claude read:write/monster-detectives/audio/lines/maddie/maddie_line14.mp3"
    },
    {
      "line": 15,
      "text": "Good work, team. Livy, great catch on the rope.",
      "start": 39.26,
      "end": 43.57,
      "duration": 4.31,
      "file": "/Users/louisburwell/Documents/Claude read:write/monster-detectives/audio/lines/maddie/maddie_line15.mp3"
    },
    {
      "line": 16,
      "text": "And you. Best nose on the team. The absolute worst listener on the team.",
      "start": 43.49,
      "end": 49.49,
      "duration": 6.0,
      "file": "/Users/louisburwell/Documents/Claude read:write/monster-detectives/audio/lines/maddie/maddie_line16.mp3"
    },
    {
      "line": 17,
      "text": "Looks like we've got another case.",
      "start": 49.41,
      "end": 51.85,
      "duration": 2.44,
      "file": "/Users/louisburwell/Documents/Claude read:write/monster-detectives/audio/lines/maddie/maddie_line17.mp3"
    }
  ],
  "livy": [
    {
      "line": 1,
      "text": "I already found footprints on the porch!",
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 3.4,
      "duration": 3.4,
      "file": "/Users/louisburwell/Documents/Claude read:write/monster-detectives/audio/lines/livy/livy_line01.mp3"
    },
    {
      "line": 2,
      "text": "I know. I just like finding things.",
      "start": 3.32,
      "end": 6.23,
      "duration": 2.91,
      "file": "/Users/louisburwell/Documents/Claude read:write/monster-detectives/audio/lines/livy/livy_line02.mp3"
    },
    {
      "line": 3,
      "text": "Wait. Where's Kobe?",
      "start": 6.15,
      "end": 7.68,
      "duration": 1.53,
      "file": "/Users/louisburwell/Documents/Claude read:write/monster-detectives/audio/lines/livy/livy_line03.mp3"
    },
    {
      "line": 4,
      "text": "Look \u2014 drag marks. Whatever did this went that way.",
      "start": 7.6,
      "end": 11.82,
      "duration": 4.22,
      "file": "/Users/louisburwell/Documents/Claude read:write/monster-detectives/audio/lines/livy/livy_line04.mp3"
    },
    {
      "line": 5,
      "text": "He definitely found something.",
      "start": 11.74,
      "end": 14.33,
      "duration": 2.59,
      "file": "/Users/louisburwell/Documents/Claude read:write/monster-detectives/audio/lines/livy/livy_line05.mp3"
    },
    {
      "line": 6,
      "text": "He went left! There's bandage fluff everywhere!",
      "start": 14.25,
      "end": 18.2,
      "duration": 3.95,
      "file": "/Users/louisburwell/Documents/Claude read:write/monster-detectives/audio/lines/livy/livy_line06.mp3"
    },
    {
      "line": 7,
      "text": "Wait \u2014 look. The scarecrow's arm is bent all the way back. And there's rope, chewed clean through.",
      "start": 18.12,
      "end": 25.74,
      "duration": 7.62,
      "file": "/Users/louisburwell/Documents/Claude read:write/monster-detectives/audio/lines/livy/livy_line07.mp3"
    },
    {
      "line": 8,
      "text": "This was eaten. Look how frayed it is at the top, not the bottom. There's also black hair on it!",
      "start": 25.66,
      "end": 34.58,
      "duration": 8.92,
      "file": "/Users/louisburwell/Documents/Claude read:write/monster-detectives/audio/lines/livy/livy_line08.mp3"
    },
    {
      "line": 9,
      "text": "Here's what happened. Some animal must have chewed through the rope.",
      "start": 34.5,
      "end": 39.45,
      "duration": 4.95,
      "file": "/Users/louisburwell/Documents/Claude read:write/monster-detectives/audio/lines/livy/livy_line09.mp3"
    },
    {
      "line": 10,
      "text": "When the rope broke, the scarecrow swung into the mummy statue, and its arm caught the wrapping and pulled the whole thing loose as it fell.",
      "start": 39.37,
      "end": 49.92,
      "duration": 10.55,
      "file": "/Users/louisburwell/Documents/Claude read:write/monster-detectives/audio/lines/livy/livy_line10.mp3"
    },
    {
      "line": 11,
      "text": "...where Kobe found it and decided it was the best toy in the world.",
      "start": 49.84,
      "end": 55.27,
      "duration": 5.43,
      "file": "/Users/louisburwell/Documents/Claude read:write/monster-detectives/audio/lines/livy/livy_line11.mp3"
    },
    {
      "line": 12,
      "text": "No, no \u2014 not a werewolf, not a vampire bat. Just a silly puppy who loves to snack on everything.",
      "start": 55.19,
      "end": 65.62,
      "duration": 10.43,
      "file": "/Users/louisburwell/Documents/Claude read:write/monster-detectives/audio/lines/livy/livy_line12.mp3"
    },
    {
      "line": 13,
      "text": "Thank you, VayVay \u2014 you reminding us werewolves and vampires don't live downtown is what helped us solve this case.",
      "start": 65.54,
      "end": 76.25,
      "duration": 10.71,
      "file": "/Users/louisburwell/Documents/Claude read:write/monster-detectives/audio/lines/livy/livy_line13.mp3"
    },
    {
      "line": 14,
      "text": "I'm on it!",
      "start": 76.17,
      "end": 77.4,
      "duration": 1.23,
      "file": "/Users/louisburwell/Documents/Claude read:write/monster-detectives/audio/lines/livy/livy_line14.mp3"
    }
  ]
}